    "verdict": "approved",
    "note": "Initial verdict REQUEST-CHANGES; all findings resolved before approval. MAJOR M1: score parse moved from throwing std::stoi to non-throwing std::from_chars with full-ptr/errc and 0..5 checks, so an over-long digit run fails closed (regression test added). MINOR m1: theme gate is key-based on frontmatter theme/look and directive-local in-body %%{init theme}%% scans, so a task label containing the word theme is not falsely rejected (tests added). m2: title/section/label/actor now pass unicode_text. m3: this review id replaced the placeholder. m4: the durable gate now renders and pins the body track separately and asserts the restored frame. NITs: task cap renamed kJourneyMaxTasksPerSection (per-section bound), CRLF trailing CR stripped, section names length-capped. The matrix hook only ever emits ledger statuses for exact ledger paths and replaces the run_case observation 1:1, so the 2738 observation total and the flow 48-gap/Class285 frozen contracts are unreachable from this change."
